    {
      "name": "Animate Boulders",
      "type": "feat",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>The galeb duhr magically animates up to two boulders it can see within 60 feet of it. A boulder has statistics like those of a galeb duhr, except it has Intelligence 1 and Charisma 1, it can’t be &amp;Reference[charmed]{charmed} or &amp;Reference[frightened]{frightened}, and it lacks this action option. A boulder remains animated as long as the galeb duhr maintains concentration, up to 1 minute (as if concentrating on a spell).</p>",
          "chat": ""
        },
