    {
      "name": "Rolling Charge",
      "type": "feat",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-8E4bf80mRpxRC4ll\"><p>If the galeb duhr rolls at least 20 feet straight toward a target and then hits it with a slam attack on the same turn, the target takes an extra 7 (2d6) bludgeoning damage. If the target is a creature, it must succeed on a DC 16 Strength saving throw or be knocked prone.</p></section><p>The Galeb Duhr rolls towards its target.</p>",
